{"code":"162300","name":"신스틸","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"철강","sector_desc":"철강재 생산·가공. 중국 공급, 원료(철광석·석탄) 가격, 건설·조선 수요에 연동되는 경기 민감 업종입니다.","desc":"동사는 2008년 설립된 철강코일센터(SSC) 전문 기업으로, 칼라강판 등 강판류 및 철강재를 고객 요구에 맞게 절단 및 전단하여 판매하는 사업을 영위하고 있음. 국내에 3개 종속회사를 보유하고, 해외에는 태국과 멕시코에 법인을 운영하며 글로벌 생산거점을 확보하고 있음. 주요 거래처는 LG전자, 삼성전자 등 국내외 가전제품 제조회사이며, 강판류 가공서비스와 철강재 상품유통 및 보관서비스를 제공하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-21","n_days":300,"close":2045.0,"open":2020.0,"high":2080.0,"low":2020.0,"volume":119583,"amount":244547235.0,"ret_1d":1.7413,"gap":0.4975,"range_pct":2.934,"ret_5":2.919,"ret_20":-19.6464,"ret_60":34.7167,"ret_120":9.0085,"ret_250":4.1773,"ma20":2110.7,"ma60":1946.6167,"ma120":1831.6,"ma200":1779.575,"close_vs_ma200":14.9151,"close_vs_ma60":5.0541,"ma_align":1,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":571.586,"r2_60":0.4394,"slope_120":62.4056,"r2_120":0.1625,"slope_250":7.2844,"r2_250":0.0271,"high52":3155.0,"low52":1335.0,"pos_52w":39.011,"dd_52w":-35.1823,"mdd_1y":-37.0787,"atr14_pct":8.2361,"vol_ann_60":108.4962,"vol_avg20":1052410.25,"vol_ratio20":0.1136,"vr5":0.0971,"vr20":0.7856,"amount_avg5":519927991.4,"amount_avg20":2302649065.05,"amount_avg60":6216293667.4667,"obv_chg20":-19.8355,"turnover_20":50.7536,"pv_eff_20":-0.3871,"rsi14":47.4455,"frgn_net_5":234811.0,"inst_net_5":68462.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":0.5662,"inst_net_5_pct":0.1651,"smart_net_5_pct":0.7313,"frgn_net_20":-8298.0,"inst_net_20":124821.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":-0.02,"inst_net_20_pct":0.301,"smart_net_20_pct":0.281,"frgn_net_60":297367.0,"inst_net_60":-40148.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":0.717,"inst_net_60_pct":-0.0968,"smart_net_60_pct":0.6202,"frgn_net_120":310503.0,"inst_net_120":-83275.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":0.7487,"inst_net_120_pct":-0.2008,"smart_net_120_pct":0.5479,"foreign_ratio":2.42,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":1.86,"smart_buy_streak":5,"op_income_q":7.0,"op_margin_q":0.6938,"op_qoq":40.0,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":null,"rev_yoy":10.7574,"op_trend_4q":19.1304,"fin_period":"202606","roe":1.44,"debt_ratio":183.83,"per":70.52,